{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>מתיך.</b> The sense: your women shall be widowed because their men die by the sword. And the word מתיך draws itself [i.e., is construct state] and another word with it, like והנבואה עודד הנביא (2 Chronicles 15:8), and likewise ומתי גבורתך."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:52:09.514401120Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}